Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.18,0:00:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Criss-Cross, are you available to help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want, I'll protect Jolyne.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.06,0:00:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take this creepy old geezer out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Direction facing southeast, 127\Ndegrees, 30 minutes, 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be aware you won't survive this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,West-southwest, 225 degrees, zero minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, FF, he's right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, your real\Nenemy is that insane old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:00:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:01:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now his arm is flying right\Nto the back of FF's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no freaking way\Nthat was a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.58,0:01:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That inmate's glasses flew straight at\NFF and lodged themselves in their face?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunate direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.18,0:01:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's feng shui in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's geomancy for the East Asians.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.22,0:01:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,With that dragon stand, Kenzo can perfectly\Ncontrol the direction of his attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.42,0:01:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,FF, next unlucky spot is here,\Nright above your left ear. Feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that did just happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.56,0:01:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My stand attack has merged\Nwith the course of your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.18,0:01:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No! FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.66,0:01:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad. Really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:01:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:01:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.32,0:02:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The unlucky direction\Nexists in our bodies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.30,0:02:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That can only mean one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It means that once the direction's chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.76,0:02:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,no organism can defend themselves or\Nescape the cruel inevitability of dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,His next target will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,you, Jolene. Hi-ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.10,0:02:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When I said this is bad just now, it\Nwasn't about the giant hole in FF's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.14,0:02:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,To be totally honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the plain fact that they're injured\Nand bleeding is more of a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's barely any blood at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Their wounds are so severe that there's\Nnot enough fluids left to keep them alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All the FFs in their body are\Nalmost completely wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy none of it spilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, that's unlucky for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.98,0:03:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.54,0:03:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and find a way. I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.18,0:03:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I am to the top. Break out. We are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.86,0:04:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I am I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,am
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I am
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.90,0:04:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here, Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're losing your touch,\Nold man! Never again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.52,0:04:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never be careless and step\Naway from the safe direction again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew better than that,\Nand I am better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:04:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.84,0:04:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He got away from me to a safe direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, speaking of directions,\NI'm learning something valuable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How I can best breach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a mirror right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can create a mirror mid-air,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can beam the dragon's\Nreflection off its surface
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and fool Kenzo into moving\Naway from his safe space!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.20,0:05:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That gives me the perfect window to\Nbeat up that rotting bag of skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What I need the most is water!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can use water to make\Na mirror, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I need it to recover\Nfrom my injuries, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.28,0:05:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But the only way I can possibly make a\Nmirror mid-air is if I can get some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.66,0:05:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In the not-so-distant past,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,some 30,000 loyal disciples of mine\Nworshipped me, eagerly learned my teachings,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and rapidly followed in my footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.44,0:05:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since being incarcerated here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,their love and loyalty has\Nturned into pure disgust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.74,0:05:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone looked down on me,\Nlaughed, and turned away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even degenerates that\Nabducted children and did
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.58,0:06:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,unspeakable things to them\Nsaw me as beneath them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty long, hard years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.45,0:06:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was true honor, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.86,0:06:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty years ago, I was at the\Ntop of the world, a shining star.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And my former glory will return, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My wisdom on feng shui,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,which rendered me the only survivor of\Nthat fire, appeared in the form of a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,As sure as I'm floating\Nhere glaring at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,people will soon call me Founder once\Nagain, and they will all follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,even if I never see\Noutside this prison again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I have left\Nto do now is finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,For the last time, you show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I command you now, Drake Dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You will show me the precise\Ndirection of my finishing attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there, FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.44,0:06:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other side of the stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a fire hose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Run and grab it, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.78,0:07:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of just standing there\Nwatching and giving commentary,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you could help out FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a stand user, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.12,0:07:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you could beat\Nthat old bastard together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.48,0:07:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help if FF dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.94,0:07:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I came here, helping\NFF was never part of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.50,0:07:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The sworn agreement was\Nto protect only you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, FF said themself\Nnot to step in for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They saw that you were injured when\Nwe got here and asked me to protect
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you from other dangerous enemies who\Nare still in the punishment cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get the water running now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is the faucet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful what you touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your unlucky direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You must protect it fiercely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:08:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, a definite\Nattack will head your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.64,0:08:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to be doing\Nsomething silly like drinking water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,At their own will!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.94,0:08:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,FF, no! What are you doing? Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.86,0:08:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,An attack has already\Nbeen decided, get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not going to end well for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather than a decided attack\Nor being led into bad luck,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it looks like more than anything else,?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.74,0:08:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,what FF really needs is water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They purposely removed their arms\Nto fit their body into the hose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.74,0:08:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.98,0:08:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They managed to get...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.78,0:09:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Feng Shui assassination has now begun. Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.30,0:09:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it's obvious you wanted to get\Nsome water and clearly you need it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.26,0:09:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm delighted to inform you that\Nnothing will go your way anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.62,0:09:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My attacks will continue to become\Nyour bad fortune from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Feng Shui\Nassassination, Drake's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.36,0:09:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all predetermined.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot stop destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.44,0:09:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They almost got water, but then couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.64,0:09:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't even let them touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.92,0:09:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Directly beneath the discipline\Ncell here is the execution room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, it's Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Capital punishment is a big thing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Two or three people every\Nyear are executed by
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,electrocution in the chair\Ndown in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.52,0:09:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And it uses 2,800 volts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.28,0:10:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so close to the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was able to break the faucet off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to get the\Nwater from up there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If things don't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.50,0:10:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The planktons would certainly be\Nannihilated in less than a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.44,0:10:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.56,0:10:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it already live?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that many turns on\Nwhen the counter hits zero?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.70,0:10:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can help it, it won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.60,0:10:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,After I unleash my attacks, what's\Nthe end going to look like for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.44,0:11:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That situation anyone could perfectly\Npredict what was going to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.94,0:11:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He could kiss my ass look at the\Nwater dripping from above before that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's already been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be\Nsitting in that chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.98,0:11:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get your water, so give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.66,0:11:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And the timing's absolutely perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The precise time of the finishing blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god, FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the definitive direction of attack,\Nand the perfect direction of protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.20,0:12:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Feng Shui assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It took 40 years to achieve, but this\Ncan only mean that I finally mastered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The founder has been resurrected at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, I'll go down\Nin history as a Buddha.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.38,0:12:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,equivalent in power and\Nglory to Shaka Mooney!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.68,0:12:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-hah-hah-hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.06,0:12:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm neutral, old man, so it's not like\NI'm gonna help you out or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But you see, FF did\Nmanage to obtain water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mere moments ago, in fact,\Nwhen you kicked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.14,0:12:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna know how?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because a 78-year-old like\Nyou ran around hysterically,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.12,0:12:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You perspired abundantly\Nbecause FF made you run around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.14,0:13:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sweat is the water they\Nused, and you missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.14,0:13:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that FF can\Ncreate mirrors using sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.26,0:13:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All it takes is about a third of\Na glass to make a functional one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.10,0:13:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You provided more than enough for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.76,0:13:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, if you're\Nlooking at a reflection of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,that's not at all your safe direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.66,0:13:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, quite the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an official tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing that'll seal away the\Nperfect feng shui assassination is a tie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.54,0:13:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,FF made their resolve\Nspecifically for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.72,0:13:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this and choke on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.78,0:13:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can share some good fortune with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.98,0:13:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I say? The legend!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Brian!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:13:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen next?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll keep looking for the bone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really what you\Nshould be focused on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver lining.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.02,0:14:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,At least there's no way Kenzo's feng shui\Nassassination can attack you anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the sacrifice for it, we know\Nit was indeed an invincible stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Preposterous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Jolyn Kujo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.66,0:14:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.10,0:14:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The damage your body has suffered is far\Nmore severe and extensive than you realize!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Also you should know by now\Nthat the planktons inside FF
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,were already killed by the\N2800 volts shot through them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.64,0:14:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't possibly repair that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.14,0:14:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon is still there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.86,0:14:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So did they let go of\NKenzo's hand too early?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.44,0:15:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess this happened because planktons\Ncan't handle electricity like humans can!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kenzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.54,0:15:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.96,0:15:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to release\Nyour stand in your condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.34,0:15:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the raw fury of revenge driving this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not leaving him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.22,0:15:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.24,0:15:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't own it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but you'll never hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.42,0:15:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to annihilate you and then\NI'll be back as the founder at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, so that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.46,0:15:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's patently clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his safe direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.74,0:15:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You were trying to figure out\Nthe place Kenzo just escaped to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can track down the actual safe\Nspot that's protected from all attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,then the FFs that scattered,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.30,0:15:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,along with the sweat that they\Nused to create the mirror,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.22,0:16:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,should still be safe and intact there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.60,0:16:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It should have been safe even\Nfrom the 2800 volt surge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.64,0:16:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You attacked the old man\Nto find that exact spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.86,0:16:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,F-Faps survived!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.38,0:16:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I fucking knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, that's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you truly think you've beaten me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You believe you could force me to\Nsurrender with that pathetic attempt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to finish you off, Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.26,0:16:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan to do so has never wavered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.88,0:16:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you refuse to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're already lying in the dead center of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,the direction of my\NFeng Shui assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.66,0:16:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escape, so you\Nmight as well give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean's threat is finding\Nits way inside the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.58,0:16:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My attack is imminent, woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bad fortune is an absolute reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:17:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what attack\NI choose to use on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.06,0:17:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,your demise has been chosen\Nand you cannot evade it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.98,0:17:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I won
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.34,0:17:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow down before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no change in\Nreviving the founder either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.01,0:17:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I hit her, didn't I, Drake's dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is confirm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My instant death kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It hit Jolene, which means my Feng Shui\Nassassination is definite and true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak, you silly lizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.22,0:17:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, your finishing blow\Ndefinitely smashed right into her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.06,0:17:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why is Jolene safe and\Nsound down there and I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,barely clinging onto this\Nrailing like a broken spider?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.78,0:17:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:18:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon, tell me the\Nsafe direction now! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.60,0:18:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, waste dragon, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you drifting away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.26,0:18:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me my safe direction\Nand hurry up! But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.40,0:18:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you coming with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.60,0:18:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who wants to\Nsay those words, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one drifting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who let go voluntarily\Nand started falling to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.26,0:18:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no one to blame\Nbut yourself, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.76,0:18:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.32,0:18:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, give your direction to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.98,0:18:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And I told you, you're the one\Ndrifting away from me, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.74,0:18:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, about your legs,\Nthey look very strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be something\Nterribly wrong with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.28,0:18:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,When you were kicking Jolene before, did\Nthey perhaps do something to your legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.74,0:18:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What? The?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.82,0:19:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what Jolene's threat stand\Nlooks like, and that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it possibly be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.50,0:19:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The stand that's emerging\Nfrom inside Jolene is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dive or drive, and I insured\Nit dove into her body itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.02,0:19:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,See, if a particular attack\Non Jolene has been decided,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.68,0:19:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,then that just means I protect her right\Nwhen the kick lands, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.46,0:19:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My name!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.40,0:19:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This man that FF brought\Nwith them, Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He slipped his own powerful\Nstand into my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.14,0:19:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and then it permanently destroyed\Nboth of Kenzo's legs like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He basically turned his flesh and\Nbones into a giant pile of plasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.30,0:20:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then just as quickly, he reassembled\Nthem into functional springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.32,0:20:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A suspension of flesh and bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kenzo doesn't feel pain right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That goes for me, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.92,0:20:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,because of the stand that made the\Nprisoners and guards fight each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.56,0:20:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Although...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.20,0:20:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.32,0:20:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She spared nothing, even my hips!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me my safe direction, dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.68,0:20:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't reach!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.50,0:20:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is an ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A guy who would do something so brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, who is he, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.98,0:20:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.84,0:20:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You just keep looking at\Nme with those pretty eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.18,0:21:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take your eyes off of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your safe direction is northeast,\Nand your lucky color, cerulean blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.08,0:21:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must inform you,\Nyou're all out of chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.76,0:21:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In only a few minutes of battle,\Nyou've aged exponentially further.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.02,0:21:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,my head is filled with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.76,0:21:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.68,0:22:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,other than here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.40,0:22:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.94,0:22:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.58,0:22:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,About my destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.66,0:22:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All the things I'd
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.02,0:22:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,like to do in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.34,0:22:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,a distant dreamer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.42,0:23:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,From today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.52,0:23:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.30,0:23:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.21,0:23:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I just started to feel\Na lot of pain suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.70,0:23:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But we need to find them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.14,0:23:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the bone?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.38,0:23:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And the little guy that picked it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.22,0:23:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.80,0:23:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna repair your wounds now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.70,0:23:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.42,0:23:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get it back, and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.96,0:23:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It has Tad's disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.80,0:24:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you Thank you.
